TAP user_question.2 0 0 w:and 1  # 'and you': needs w:and at 0..0
BIAS D user_question.2 -1  # AND of the 2 required parts of 'and you'
LINK U user_question D:user_question.2 1  # 'and you' is one way of saying: the user turns the question back
UNIT D user_question.3  # detector for '^ you $' (the user turns the question back)
