TAP q_form.0 0 0 c:wh 1  # '^ @wh': needs c:wh at 0..0
BIAS D q_form.0 -1  # AND of the 2 required parts of '^ @wh'
LINK U q_form D:q_form.0 1  # '^ @wh' is one way of saying: the message is shaped like a question even without a question mark
