TAP q_form.2.1 2 2 w:play|w:like|w:have|w:know|w:watch|w:go|w:want|w:ever|w:got|w:think|w:need|w:use|w:eat|w:do|w:live|w:work|w:study|w:listen|w:read|w:drive|w:cook|w:get|w:believe|w:remember|w:mind|w:care|w:wanna 1  # '^ and|so|but you play|like|have|know|watch|go|want|ever|got|think|need|use|eat|do|live|work|study|listen|read|drive|cook|get|believe|remember|mind|care|wanna': needs w:play|w:like|w:have|w:know|w:watch|w:go|w:want|w:ever|w:got|w:think|w:need|w:use|w:eat|w:do|w:live|w:work|w:study|w:listen|w:read|w:drive|w:cook|w:get|w:believe|w:remember|w:mind|w:care|w:wanna at 2..2
TAP q_form.2.1 0 0 pos:start 1  # '^ and|so|but you play|like|have|know|watch|go|want|ever|got|think|need|use|eat|do|live|work|study|listen|read|drive|cook|get|believe|remember|mind|care|wanna': needs pos:start at 0..0
TAP q_form.2.1 0 0 w:and|w:so|w:but 1  # '^ and|so|but you play|like|have|know|watch|go|want|ever|got|think|need|use|eat|do|live|work|study|listen|read|drive|cook|get|believe|remember|mind|care|wanna': needs w:and|w:so|w:but at 0..0
BIAS D q_form.2.1 -3  # AND of the 4 required parts of '^ and|so|but you play|like|have|know|watch|go|want|ever|got|think|need|use|eat|do|live|work|study|listen|read|drive|cook|get|believe|remember|mind|care|wanna'
LINK U q_form D:q_form.2.1 1  # '^ and|so|but you play|like|have|know|watch|go|want|ever|got|think|need|use|eat|do|live|work|study|listen|read|drive|cook|get|believe|remember|mind|care|wanna' is one way of saying: the message is shaped like a question even without a question mark
UNIT D q_form.3  # detector for '^ ever' (the message is shaped like a question even without a question mark)
TAP q_form.3 0 0 pos:start 1  # '^ ever': needs pos:start at 0..0
TAP q_form.3 0 0 w:ever 1  # '^ ever': needs w:ever at 0..0
BIAS D q_form.3 -1  # AND of the 2 required parts of '^ ever'
LINK U q_form D:q_form.3 1  # '^ ever' is one way of saying: the message is shaped like a question even without a question mark
UNIT D q_form.3.1  # detector for '^ and|so ever' (the message is shaped like a question even without a question mark)
TAP q_form.3.1 1 1 w:ever 1  # '^ and|so ever': needs w:ever at 1..1
TAP q_form.3.1 0 0 pos:start 1  # '^ and|so ever': needs pos:start at 0..0
TAP q_form.3.1 0 0 w:and|w:so 1  # '^ and|so ever': needs w:and|w:so at 0..0
BIAS D q_form.3.1 -2  # AND of the 3 required parts of '^ and|so ever'
LINK U q_form D:q_form.3.1 1  # '^ and|so ever' is one way of saying: the message is shaped like a question even without a question mark
