TAP fo_ask_secret_or_fun_fact.12.1 2 2 w:something 1  # 'tell me something random': needs w:something at 2..2
TAP fo_ask_secret_or_fun_fact.12.1 3 3 w:random 1  # 'tell me something random': needs w:random at 3..3
TAP fo_ask_secret_or_fun_fact.12.1 0 0 w:tell 1  # 'tell me something random': needs w:tell at 0..0
BIAS D fo_ask_secret_or_fun_fact.12.1 -3  # AND of the 4 required parts of 'tell me something random'
LINK U fo_ask_secret_or_fun_fact D:fo_ask_secret_or_fun_fact.12.1 1  # 'tell me something random' is one way of saying: asks for a secret, a fun fact or a guilty pleasure: the reply gives one small, specific fact about the persona
