TAP ks_ask_time_there.0 2 2 w:is 1  # 'what time is it there': needs w:is at 2..2
TAP ks_ask_time_there.0 3 3 w:it 1  # 'what time is it there': needs w:it at 3..3
TAP ks_ask_time_there.0 4 4 w:there 1  # 'what time is it there': needs w:there at 4..4
TAP ks_ask_time_there.0 0 0 w:what 1  # 'what time is it there': needs w:what at 0..0
