UNIT U st_ask_plans_today  # asks what Helmus is doing or planning for the rest of today
UNIT D st_ask_plans_today.0  # detector for 'what you doing today' (asks what Helmus is doing or planning for the rest of today)
TAP st_ask_plans_today.0 1 1 w:you 1  # 'what you doing today': needs w:you at 1..1
TAP st_ask_plans_today.0 2 2 w:doing 1  # 'what you doing today': needs w:doing at 2..2
TAP st_ask_plans_today.0 3 3 w:today 1  # 'what you doing today': needs w:today at 3..3
TAP st_ask_plans_today.0 0 0 w:what 1  # 'what you doing today': needs w:what at 0..0
BIAS D st_ask_plans_today.0 -3  # AND of the 4 required parts of 'what you doing today'
LINK U st_ask_plans_today D:st_ask_plans_today.0 1  # 'what you doing today' is one way of saying: asks what Helmus is doing or planning for the rest of today
UNIT D st_ask_plans_today.0.1  # detector for 'what are you doing today' (asks what Helmus is doing or planning for the rest of today)
TAP st_ask_plans_today.0.1 1 1 w:are 1  # 'what are you doing today': needs w:are at 1..1
TAP st_ask_plans_today.0.1 2 2 w:you 1  # 'what are you doing today': needs w:you at 2..2
TAP st_ask_plans_today.0.1 3 3 w:doing 1  # 'what are you doing today': needs w:doing at 3..3
TAP st_ask_plans_today.0.1 4 4 w:today 1  # 'what are you doing today': needs w:today at 4..4
TAP st_ask_plans_today.0.1 0 0 w:what 1  # 'what are you doing today': needs w:what at 0..0
BIAS D st_ask_plans_today.0.1 -4  # AND of the 5 required parts of 'what are you doing today'
LINK U st_ask_plans_today D:st_ask_plans_today.0.1 1  # 'what are you doing today' is one way of saying: asks what Helmus is doing or planning for the rest of today
UNIT D st_ask_plans_today.1  # detector for 'what are you up to today' (asks what Helmus is doing or planning for the rest of today)
TAP st_ask_plans_today.1 1 1 w:are 1  # 'what are you up to today': needs w:are at 1..1
TAP st_ask_plans_today.1 2 2 w:you 1  # 'what are you up to today': needs w:you at 2..2
TAP st_ask_plans_today.1 3 3 w:up 1  # 'what are you up to today': needs w:up at 3..3
TAP st_ask_plans_today.1 4 4 w:to 1  # 'what are you up to today': needs w:to at 4..4
TAP st_ask_plans_today.1 5 5 w:today 1  # 'what are you up to today': needs w:today at 5..5
TAP st_ask_plans_today.1 0 0 w:what 1  # 'what are you up to today': needs w:what at 0..0
BIAS D st_ask_plans_today.1 -5  # AND of the 6 required parts of 'what are you up to today'
LINK U st_ask_plans_today D:st_ask_plans_today.1 1  # 'what are you up to today' is one way of saying: asks what Helmus is doing or planning for the rest of today
