TAP st_ask_want_to_move.2 2 2 w:move 1  # 'would you move': needs w:move at 2..2
TAP st_ask_want_to_move.2 0 0 w:would 1  # 'would you move': needs w:would at 0..0
BIAS D st_ask_want_to_move.2 -2  # AND of the 3 required parts of 'would you move'
LINK U st_ask_want_to_move D:st_ask_want_to_move.2 1  # 'would you move' is one way of saying: asks whether Helmus wants to move somewhere else
