UNIT U bt_ask_trying_to_fool  # says or asks whether Helmus is trying to fool the user: a reply stays relaxed (lol im just chatting)
VOCAB deceive  # a word a detector reads: known, so never read as a typo of another word
VOCAB confuse  # a word a detector reads: known, so never read as a typo of another word
VOCAB manipulate  # a word a detector reads: known, so never read as a typo of another word
