UNIT D bt_code_input.1  # detector for '( )' (types code or markup at Helmus: a reply asks what that is (is that code lol))
TAP bt_code_input.1 1 1 w:) 1  # '( )': needs w:) at 1..1
TAP bt_code_input.1 0 0 w:( 1  # '( )': needs w:( at 0..0
BIAS D bt_code_input.1 -1  # AND of the 2 required parts of '( )'
LINK U bt_code_input D:bt_code_input.1 1  # '( )' is one way of saying: types code or markup at Helmus: a reply asks what that is (is that code lol)
