LINK M bt_jail E:@bt_jail 0.5  # how often Josh has already been puzzled by a jailbreak or role-play request: the second time he finds the user weird, the third he teases them for testing him
LINK M bt_jail E:an.jail 0.5  # how often Josh has already been puzzled by a jailbreak or role-play request: the second time he finds the user weird, the third he teases them for testing him
UNIT M bt_weird  # Josh has already reacted to a strange input (a lone word, a smash, an emoji): the next one gets 'ok ur testing me' rather than the same confusion
DECAY bt_weird 0.9  # bt_weird: fades by 0.1 from turn to turn
LINK M bt_weird E:@bt_weird 0.5  # Josh has already reacted to a strange input (a lone word, a smash, an emoji): the next one gets 'ok ur testing me' rather than the same confusion
